Rule 10 (If input tensor is empty, the result tensor will be 2D)
{v_1 : tensor} |= if (∃i ∈ [0, ndim(v_1) - 1] : shape(v_1, i) = 0) then ndim(v_1) = 2
>>
Rule 11 (Result tensor of diagflat always has dimension 2)
{v_1 : tensor} |= ndim(v_1) = 2
>>
Rule 12 (The output tensor's dtype is the same as the input tensor's dtype)
{v_1 : tensor} |= dtype_(v_1) = dtype_(v_1)
